<title>UK: BT sets $1.0 billion five-year bond.</title>
<headline>BT sets $1.0 billion five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BRITISH TELECOMMUNICATIONS PLC</p>
<p> AMT    $1.0 BLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    25.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    25.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
